# GIT & GITHUB — Mozentai

## Repository

- **Remote:** `github.com:Mozentai/mozentai.com.git`
- **Branch:** `main` (auto-deploys to GitHub Pages)
- **Domain:** mozentai.com (`CNAME`)

## Commit messages

- Short imperative summary (1-2 sentences), focus on why
- Use HEREDOC for commit body
- NEVER force-push to `main`
- Only commit when user asks OR when completing site work (project rule: always deploy)

## Deploy workflow

File: `.github/workflows/pages.yml`

On push to `main`:
1. Jekyll build via `actions/jekyll-build-pages@v1`
2. Deploy via `actions/deploy-pages@v4`

Verify:
```bash
gh run list --workflow=pages.yml --limit 3
gh run watch <run-id>
```

## Rules

- Use `gh` CLI for GitHub operations
- NEVER skip hooks unless explicitly requested
- NEVER commit `Gemfile.lock` (gitignored)
- NEVER update git config
